codex
The existing model matches all 64 earlier examples. Its weights show reduced sensitivity to anger and a 20-point logit bonus for EU alerts.

I will add a ReLU branch that enforces the new escalation rule. It will preserve every decision outside the condition, including at error_rate = 0.70. Some negative logit values will change, but their decisions will stay the same.
